# The approach to Mother Brain and the confrontation's NO (build 92).
# NoahF1's corridor floor (block $33, column 16) is the approach
# (loc_70D6): at the leader's cell 33 (y $218) with mother_brain_fought
# ($C747) clear, the level loads again with the party at x $210 on his
# row, and the arrival scene (loc_7E02 case $E) puts him one cell down,
# facing up, with Mother Brain's image forming between two energy arcs.
# Once she stands, the confrontation: $1813 and a YES/NO. NO is $1816
# (running on into $1817), then the windows close and her image goes.
# Walking north again starts it all over. Before build 92 the corridor
# printed "walk: loc_70D6 (level $64) is not ported" and nothing happened.

start level $64 33 37
wait idle
walk up 4                    # returns as the fourth step begins
wait idle                    # at rest on cell 33
wait ticks 2                 # the floor is looked at: the approach
wait idle                    # the reload, the image forming, $1813 to its first {pause}
expect level $64 33 34
expect object $2C visible
expect script $1813
shot 01_image_formed
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle                    # the YES/NO
shot 02_first_question
press down
press c                      # NO
wait idle
expect script $1816
shot 03_no_answer
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
wait ticks 4
expect object $2C absent     # deleted after the event's last step
expect flag $C747 0
shot 04_image_gone
walk up 1                    # the arrival left him on 34: north to 33
wait idle
wait ticks 2
wait idle                    # the approach again: the whole scene over
expect script $1813
expect no-stderr not ported
